      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "The outside barrier presents a challenge to SHOWMETHETANLINES NZ (12) but he is a capable colt who has come back in good form. Worked to the front and cruised home by 26m here first up then placed in a handy line-up of three-year-olds last week. His strike rate at this circuit and distance stands at 50 per cent and he possesses gate speed so could overcome the draw. BEROCCA BERNIE (3) comes through the Breeders Challenge series where he produced some good efforts including a fourth from a wider barrier here two back. Draws to play a role. ETHANS REVENGE (6) also recorded some solid Breeders Challenge efforts and continued the honest form when beaten only 2.4m last week. Cam Hart goes back on. SNAP SHOT NZ (1) will find this easier than her last attempt against the good mares and was runner-up from a wider barrier prior. Should get her chance from the inside draw.",
